-Edgar.

501
00:39:15.060 --> 00:39:18.100
we're all grieving here.
but that's no reason to be cruel.

502
00:39:18.259 --> 00:39:19.579
-Thya. it's fine.
-It's not.

503
00:39:20.579 --> 00:39:21.579
