You can speak to me directly.

511
00:39:43.719 --> 00:39:44.960
You didn't even cry.

512
00:39:46.679 --> 00:39:48.679
Don't you think that's weird?

513
00:39:48.699 --> 00:39:49.879
People grieve in different...

514
00:39:49.880 --> 00:39:50.880
Get away from me!

515
00:40:12.210 --> 00:40:13.210
