517
00:40:16.610 --> 00:40:17.929
That's enough.

518
00:40:17.930 --> 00:40:18.946
Dad. You don't look good...

519
00:40:18.970 --> 00:40:20.690
It's your fault he's dead.

520
00:40:22.250 --> 00:40:24.230
You didn't stop him getting to the car!

521
00:40:24.410 --> 00:40:27.810
Stop it. Dad. I had nothing to do with it.
Will got into a fight with Alice. and he...

522
00:40:28.230 --> 00:40:29.726
