Oh. shut up. Susan!

803
01:23:08.190 --> 01:23:09.490
Shut the fuck up!

804
01:23:10.389 --> 01:23:13.990
I didn't bring anything to your family.
It was already there.

805
01:23:15.309 --> 01:23:16.469
You see this?

806
01:23:17.849 --> 01:23:20.549
You see. Susan? This is your son.

807
01:23:21.129 --> 01:23:22.628
This is what he was capable of.

808
01:23:22.629 --> 01:23:24.929
-Was an accident!
-No! It wasn't!

809
01:23:27.690 --> 01:23:29.510
It was not. And you knew.

810
01:23:30.630 --> 01:23:31.970
You knew. Susan.

811
01:23:33.449 --> 01:23:36.930
You deserve everything
that's happened to you.

812
01:23:38.630 --> 01:23:40.270
Every fucking thing.

813
01:23:41.130 --> 01:23:42.130
But you know what?

814
01:23:43.550 --> 01:23:44.550
It's behind me now.

815
01:23:45.270 --> 01:23:46.670
I don't give a shit anymore.

816
01:23:57.180 --> 01:23:58.180
You're right.

817
01:23:58.860 --> 01:24:01.180
Your past is behind you.

818
01:24:03.960 --> 01:24:05.800
Right... Right behind you.

819
01:24:07.180 --> 01:24:08.460
Like a shadow.

820
01:24:10.699 --> 01:24:12.359
Can't escape it.

821
01:24:13.539 --> 01:24:16.059
Just when you think you're safe.

822
01:24:16.939 --> 01:24:18.086
Healed.

823
01:24:19.099 --> 01:24:22.960
When you breathe a quivering sigh.

824
01:24:24.579 --> 01:24:27.199
my son will be there.

825
01:24:28.539 --> 01:24:30.599
As a husband should.

826
01:24:32.860 --> 01:24:37.440
And he will burn you down

827
01:24:39.280 --> 01:24:42.720
like the whore you are.

828
01:24:46.009 --> 01:24:48.245
You will be dead by dawn!

829
01:26:41.370 --> 01:26:41.970
Alice.

830
01:26:41.970 --> 01:26:42.970
Help me up.

831
01:26:43.210 --> 01:26:45.429
I know where the dagger is.
I'll help you find it.

832
01:26:47.850 --> 01:26:51.330
And then I'll cut you open with it
like my brother should have.

833
01:26:52.330 --> 01:26:54.990
You're worthless.
Just like my grandfather.

834
01:26:55.137 --> 01:26:56.321
Shut up!

835
01:26:57.110 --> 01:27:00.010
He never found it. and you never will.

836
01:27:01.650 --> 01:27:04.230
Let me end your miserable life.

837
01:27:04.930 --> 01:27:06.810
You like pain anyway.

838
01:27:10.779 --> 01:27:13.579
That's why you let Will hurt you.
Isn't it?

839
01:27:14.000 --> 01:27:17.139
Poor little Alice.

840
01:27:21.350 --> 01:27:24.170
You'll be found in an attic alone.

841
01:27:26.470 --> 01:27:28.550
Gutted from tit to tail.

842
01:27:30.190 --> 01:27:32.430
You never wanted kids anyway.

843
01:27:33.050 --> 01:27:34.390
Your body is useless.

844
01:27:52.680 --> 01:27:53.680
Wrong one.

845
01:27:57.242 --> 01:27:59.643
The Circle of the Wise Men is dead.

846
01:28:09.050 --> 01:28:10.890
Come here. you little bitch.

847
01:28:11.570 --> 01:28:13.409
I told you it's not here.

848
01:30:25.710 --> 01:30:27.690
My family will...

849
01:30:27.814 --> 01:30:28.814
Fuck your family!

850
01:31:51.280 --> 01:31:53.620
Did you stay because you liked it?

851
01:31:54.200 --> 01:31:56.839
Or you were
too much of a coward to leave me?

852
01:32:01.850 --> 01:32:03.190
Look at you now.

853
01:32:05.480 --> 01:32:07.510
You still can't leave.

854
01:32:18.050 --> 01:32:20.269
Remember the last thing you said to me?

855
01:32:24.800 --> 01:32:25.800
"Go to hell."

856
01:32:28.800 --> 01:32:30.300
You got your wish.

857
01:32:43.250 --> 01:32:46.090
I shouldn't have hurt you. Alice.

858
01:32:46.410 --> 01:32:47.710
I should have killed you.

859
01:33:05.300 --> 01:33:07.960
This is where I promised
I'd always be with you.

860
01:33:27.000 --> 01:33:30.439
Where I promised that
not even death would do us part.

861
01:33:33.000 --> 01:33:35.939
I will keep my promise. Alice.

862
01:33:42.600 --> 01:33:44.020
'Cause without me.

863
01:33:46.200 --> 01:33:47.520
you are nothing.

864
01:34:58.649 --> 01:34:59.649
Hello?

865
01:35:02.250 --> 01:35:03.469
Hello? Hello...

866
01:36:18.100 --> 01:36:22.640
I could never have lived
without you. Alice.

867
01:36:23.440 --> 01:36:25.380
I won't let you live without me.

868
01:37:04.919 --> 01:37:05.925
Shit.

869
01:37:09.910 --> 01:37:11.029
Where is the dagger?

870
01:37:14.300 --> 01:37:15.380
Where is it?

871
01:37:18.189 --> 01:37:19.189
Where is it. Alice?

872
01:37:22.350 --> 01:37:23.350
Go get it.

873
01:38:43.000 --> 01:38:44.240
Where is the dagger?

874
01:38:44.920 --> 01:38:46.760
Speak or burn. bitch!

875
01:38:48.180 --> 01:38:50.239
Here's your fucking dagger!

876
01:39:12.850 --> 01:39:13.850
I love you.

877
01:39:45.241 --> 01:39:46.866
That's not enough.

878
01:41:33.199 --> 01:41:34.260
Got a cigarette?

879
01:41:36.550 --> 01:41:39.190
-I'm not really allowed to...
-Just give it to me.

880
01:41:48.809 --> 01:41:49.809
Who did this to you?

881
01:41:57.050 --> 01:41:58.250
My ex-husband.

882
01:44:39.409 --> 01:44:41.889
Wicked little French bitch.

883
01:44:51.899 --> 01:44:54.819
Ma'am! What happened? Are you okay?

884
01:44:54.902 --> 01:45:00.574
Oh. thank heaven! Please help me!
She stole my legs!

885
01:45:02.284 --> 01:45:05.454
But yours will do just fine.

886
01:48:15.800 --> 01:48:17.179
Yes. sweetie. I know.

887
01:48:17.180 --> 01:48:19.620
It's no fun coming into work
with me on a Saturday.

888
01:48:20.360 --> 01:48:22.800
But I've had to do everything
by myself since...

889
01:48:23.340 --> 01:48:25.779
Well. you know.
I'll make it up to you tonight.

890
01:48:27.400 --> 01:48:30.760
How come you're keeping
all these urns full of dead people?

891
01:48:31.940 --> 01:48:32.940
Uh...

892
01:48:34.199 --> 01:48:35.199
Well...

893
01:48:36.039 --> 01:48:37.180
it's sad. actually.

894
01:48:37.840 --> 01:48:40.260
These are the people
whose families never came for them.

895
01:48:40.700 --> 01:48:42.379
So. we keep them here for a few months

896
01:48:42.380 --> 01:48:45.600
in case a family member
remembers to pick them up one day.

897
01:48:47.380 --> 01:48:49.420
Okay. Don't touch anything. okay?

898
01:48:49.520 --> 01:48:51.760
That might be about the cremator job.
I'll be right back.

899
01:48:59.260 --> 01:49:00.660
"Christopher Leroy."

900
01:49:03.850 --> 01:49:05.510
"Ellie Bixler."

901
01:49:06.923 --> 01:49:07.951
Hey.

902
01:49:22.220 --> 01:49:23.220
Mom?

903
01:49:24.440 --> 01:49:25.899
Don't be scared. baby.

904
01:50:09.119 --> 01:50:10.119
Mommy's back.

904
01:50:11.305 --> 01:51:11.351
